    ethernet.ipv6.sctp.f1ap.F1AP-PDU.initiatingMessage.value.DLRRCMessageTransfer.protocolIEs.Item 3.ProtocolIE-Field.value.RRCContainer.10  ).NR Radio Resource Control (RRC) protocol.DL-DCCH-Message.message.c1.rrcRelease.criticalExtensions = 0
